{"resourceIdentifier":"442","resourceName":"Sussex County Landfill Gas Combustion Project","description":"The Project involves the capture and destruction of landfill gas from the Sussex County Landfill via an expanded gas collection and flaring system. The project is owned and operated by the Sussex County Municipal Utilities Authority (SCMUA). A pre-project landfill gas collection system was installed in Phase 1 of the Landfill in 1996 and expanded into Phase 2A in 2004. This system included on-site gas wells and piping, with landfill gas being delivered to a 1MW power generation plant located off site. The power generation plant is currently owned and operated by Lafayette Energy Partners LP (Lafayette), with whom SCMUA has had a gas sales agreement since January 2007. Landfill gas collected using the pre-project system and transported off site to generate electricity is not included within the scope of the Project.","location":{"latitude":41.091830,"longitude":-74.679708},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"442"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"NJ"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Sussex County Municipal Utilities Authority"},{"type":"string","value":"Andhra Pradesh, India"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Late to verify"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"442"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"28910"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"First Environment, Inc. (First Environment)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"